ents or docstrings that obscure current behavior with repetition, obvious narration, duplicated explanation, or historical detail. The audit is pinned to `9e65567b79ffe872534c3c656ade7b34340d8192`.\n\n## Approach\nEdit explanatory text only in this directory/subsystem cohort. Condense it to current, non-obvious rationale and constraints; retain every file-specific preserve item and consumer contract below. Grouping adjacent files from one subsystem keeps the change reviewable in one session and permits one coherent verification pass without changing executable behavior.\n\n## Scope\n- `tests/unit/_opcert_helpers.py:1-8, 30-36` — Preserve storage-anchor/ordered-chain fixture contract. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/conftest.py:1-9, 22-27, 29-38, 40-58, 81-84, 87-88, 102-121, 138-157, 184-210` — Preserve import-order invariants and hermetic session-log/MCP/AWS isolation. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/gold_set_completion.py:1-24` — Preserve the frozen labelled completion-floor corpus semantics. Consumer: calibration-script and test maintainers (the module data is imported, the prose is not).\n- `tests/unit/test_8d44_cache_attestation_freshness.py:1-16, 69-70, 82-85, 93-95` — Preserve cache/evidence consistency invariant and tampered-cache fixture shape. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_a8e5_absence_veto_edge.py:83-88` — Preserve false-vs-genuine absence contrast. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_ac_satisfiability_criterion.py:1-10, 30-37, 126-132` — Preserve criterion gap, routing tier, and end-to-end wiring. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_administrative_close_dispositions.py:1-20` — Preserve admitted classes, reason/link requirements, and signed-disposition behavior. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_advanced_cli_parsers.py:1-13` — Preserve parser-factory and lazy-import contract. Consumer: none found.\n- `tests/unit/test_agent_call_memo_nudge.py:1-15, 378-382` — Preserve caching eligibility, error handling, guard orde